    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">This book shows you how to spend your valuable time on things that really matter. Overloaded? I&apos;ll bet you are. We all lead busy lives. You fall into bed exhausted at the end of the day, feeling that you&apos;ve got a lot done. Perhaps you are getting lots done. But is it stuff that really matters? Or is it just stuff ? It&apos;s time to wise up. You will never clear that list. From now on, instead of trying to clear that endless to-do list, you&apos;re going to do a much smarter thing. You&apos;re going to just do the important stuff .</marc:subfield>
